Package: phylobuild
Type: Package
Title: Somatic Phylogeny Reconstruction from Clonal Whole-Genome Sequencing
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Michael", "Spencer Chapman", email = "ms56@sanger.ac.uk", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Filtering of somatic mutations called in clonal samples (e.g. single-cell
    derived colonies), phylogeny reconstruction with MPBoot, assignment of mutations
    to branches with treemut, and sensitivity correction of branch lengths. This is the
    R side of the PhyloBuild Snakemake pipeline; see Coorens, Spencer Chapman et al.,
    Nature Protocols 19, 1866-1886 (2024) for the method.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1)
Imports:
    ape,
    data.table,
    phangorn,
    phytools,
    seqinr,
    stringr,
    treemut (>= 1.1),
    VGAM
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Remotes: nangalialab/treemut
Config/testthat/edition: 3
